    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nI did think about allowing array for `mode` since the recommended setup is too verbose (which might look intimidating for new users). This now matters more with presence of MiniMax.\n\nNot sure if allowing `keys` to be an array is a good idea, since it deviates from how `vim.keymap.set()` operates. Maybe.\n\nI'll think about it.",
